{{Quote|There's a courier coming in who has secret information. I need you to pick him up and transport him to Havoc Outpost.|[[Hera Syndulla]], to Sabine Wren|<ref name="Blood Sisters" />}}
'''Havoc Outpost''' was a trading and supply base<ref name="Helmet Collection 23">{{HelmetCollectionCite|23|Databank A-Z}}</ref> used as a rebel rendezvous point<ref name="Blood Sisters" /> in [[Wild Space]]<ref name="Timelines" /> used by the fledging rebellion during their early campaigns [[Early rebellion against the Galactic Empire|against]] the [[Galactic Empire]]. Located on the edge of a cliff overlooking a [[mountain]] [[Water|lake]],<ref name="Blood Sisters" /> the outpost had a number of landing pads surrounding a central command area featuring a flight control tower. Underground access points connected the main Havoc Outpost structure to hollowed-out spires of rock in the middle of the lake.<ref name="Helmet Collection 23" />

In [[4 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{RebelsDate|208}}</ref> [[Sabine Wren]], a [[Mandalorian]] and member of the [[Spectres]], brought the [[GNK-series power droid]] [[EG-86]], who carried information for the rebellion, to Havoc Outpost. It was delivered to the [[astromech droid]] [[R2-D2]], acting on behalf of [[Senator]] [[Bail Prestor Organa|Bail Organa]] of [[Alderaan]].<ref name="Blood Sisters" />

==Behind the scenes==
Havoc Outpost first appeared in "[[Blood Sisters]]," an episode of the [[Star Wars Rebels Season Two|second season]] of ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''.<ref name="Blood Sisters" />

